WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.334
P4.3 · Flow rules: generate them, then fit each one

2
00:00:06.484 --> 00:00:13.952
Flow rules say when the ledger's money turns into cash. Without them, K-φ shows no forecast rather than a guess.

3
00:00:14.002 --> 00:00:20.666
On GL → Cash, Auto-generate rules proposes a full set, each with its confidence.

4
00:00:21.816 --> 00:00:29.861
Receivables and payables by their age, or by the days measured in the ledger. Salaries on pay dates, loans on their schedule.

5
00:00:29.911 --> 00:00:36.639
Capex has no date to follow: its own history is the honest guess. Depreciation moves no cash.

6
00:00:37.789 --> 00:00:41.855
The coverage bar lists what has no rule yet, and proposes one.

7
00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:48.819
Projecting new sales is a detail of the receivables rule: an assumption, so it stays off until you choose it.

8
00:00:50.269 --> 00:00:53.266
Next: P4.4  Stating assumptions

